Copyright (c) 2026 Володимир Поздняк / Volodymyr Pozdniak

Vuzol-19 is intended as an open cultural and technical kernel.

The author does not claim ownership over the future, human intent, the Flower as a universal metaphor, or anyone’s personal path.

This repository defines the Vuzol-19 Book Kernel canon, runtime structure, templates, examples, prompts, world-theory files, scenes and app/runtime materials.

Because the repository contains both code-like materials and creative/canonical text, it uses a dual-license model.

