## 4. Human Gate and World-Theory Boundary

This section is project guidance, not an additional legal restriction.

Vuzol-19 is built around the Human Gate principle:

AI, Flower Scan, world theory, pyramid field, crown interface, capsule, box, calendar, cosmic model or any other system must not replace human permission.

Contributors should preserve:

- Human Gate
- FACT / MODEL / FICTION / HOLD boundaries
- AI as Guard, not God
- the right of a person or character to say yes, no or HOLD
- clear separation between factual claims, models and fictional mechanisms

Do not present MODEL or FICTION as proven FACT.

Do not use Vuzol-19 materials to coerce, diagnose, shame or control real people.

