## 7. Short version

Code can be used freely under MIT.

Text, canon, prompts, scenes, examples and worldbuilding can be shared and adapted non-commercially with attribution and share-alike under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Do not remove Human Gate.

Do not present fiction as fact.

If uncertain, choose HOLD.
